Description: temporarily disable the built-in laptop keyboard for cleaning
 Clean Your Lap Keyboard grabs the internal keyboard of a laptop so the keys
 can be wiped without typing anything, while the touchpad and external
 keyboards keep working.
 .
 The keyboard is released after the selected duration, when Stop is pressed,
 when Esc is held for two seconds, and when the screen locks, the computer
 suspends, or the session becomes inactive. A small helper performs only the
 evdev grab and never reads key events.
